{"id":"_summary","shard":"Outdoor-06","checked":300,"ok":231,"issues":69,"by_kind":{"category":23,"facets":27,"brand":11,"name":6,"variant":6,"junk":2,"duplicate":1},"high":18,"rule_gaps":["colour is derived from BRAND tokens: 'SØLVKROKEN' (sølv = silver) in the name gives color Silver on 7 fishing rows, and a 'Varemerker > Black Diamond' crumb in srcCat gives color Black to a wasabi-green bivy - deriveFacets should ignore brand crumbs and a leading brand token in the name","'Pack'/'Bag' anywhere in the name derives type 'Backpacks & bags' - it hit a 7-pack of boxer shorts and a sleeping bag","footwear breadcrumbs land in Outdoor: 'Tursko', 'Løpesko' and 'SKO > Fjell-, jakt- og hikingsko > Hikingsko' should resolve to Shoes (9 rows here)","audience: 'Wmns' maps to Women but 'Wmn' and 'Lady' do not (6 rows)","type is not derived from the pack breadcrumbs 'Dagstursekker/Dagstursekk/Tursekker/Tursekk', so ~15 backpacks in this shard have no type facet while 'Duffelbagger' and 'Ryggsekker og Vesker' work","beanies/balaclavas/gloves/insoles get type 'Tops & baselayers' whenever the name contains Wool or Fleece, while identical headwear without those words gets 'Accessories'"],"notes":"Healthy shard - 231/300 clean, all rows machine-promoted, categories mostly right because the fishing/tent/sleeping breadcrumbs are strong; the real damage is concentrated in derived facets (brand-token colours, Bag/Pack types) and in footwear that should sit in Shoes. Two secondary systemic issues need no per-row fix: every row carries the default icon 'tent', and 115 of 300 have no image (all from sampled, image-less crawls). A large body of nordic-ski and helmet gear sits in Outdoor by convention - left alone here, but it is the next boundary worth a decision."}
